  "description": "Pure-managed HEIF (ISO/IEC 23008-12) reader and decoder for .NET, written clean-room from the specifications: item structure, grid items, image properties (ispe, colr nclx/ICC, pixi, irot, imir, clap) and the HEVC decoder configuration and parameter sets (ITU-T H.265). Aimed at camera HEIF stills such as Canon's 10-bit HDR PQ .HIF. Decodes HEVC intra stills (clean-room from H.265, bit-exact against ffmpeg) inside the envelope camera files use, composes grids in parallel and applies clap/irot/imir, and converts to R'G'B' with an HDR (PQ/HLG) linear-float projection. Registered with the SharpAstro.Codecs facade. AOT-compatible.",
